{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 4, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler to Japan's fair shore\nA journey grand a sight to adore\nPrepare thyself for wonders untold\nA tale of lands both new and old.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Kyoto a City of Grace**\n\nFrom whence you came now seek this place\nKyoto's beauty a wondrous grace\nThe ancient temples stand so tall\nA peaceful haven answering all\nFushimi Inari's gates a vibrant hue\nA thousand torii a dream for you.\nGion district wander slow and free\nWhere geishas glide for all to see.\nDinner awaits a Kaiseki spread\nFine artistry expertly bred.\n\n**Day Two: Temples and Gardens a Soulful Quest**\n\nKinkaku-ji's gold a gleaming sight\nReflecting waters bathed in light\nRyoan-ji's rocks a mystic scene\nContemplation's realm serene.\nArashiyama Bamboo a verdant maze\nSunlight dappled in a golden haze.\nTenryu-ji Garden peace profound\nWhere nature's beauty can be found.\nA tea ceremony a ritual deep\nSecrets whispered while mortals sleep.\n\n**Day Three: Nara's Deer a Gentle Plea**\n\nTo Nara we ride a journey bright\nWhere friendly deer fill hearts with delight\nTodai-ji Temple holds a giant Buddha\nA sight of awe a wondrous rudder.\nKasuga Taisha lanterns glow\nA path of wishes soft and low.\nExplore the park a joyful spree\nBeneath the boughs for all to see.\n\n**Day Four: Osaka's Delights a Culinary Tour**\n\nOsaka's vibrant heart we find\nA city bustling for all mankind\nDotonbori's lights a dazzling show\nStreet food beckons to and fro.\nOsaka Castle grand and bold\nA history of stories to unfold.\nShinsekai's retro charm so sweet\nA nostalgic joy a welcome treat.\n\n**Day Five: Hakone's Beauty a Mountain View**\n\nTo Hakone's peaks we now ascend\nA scenic journey without end\nLake Ashi's waters crystal clear\nMount Fuji's presence drawing near.\nCruise the lake a gentle sway\nAdmire the landscape come what may.\nHakone Open-Air Museum art divine\nA masterpiece for all to shine.\n\n**Day Six: Return to Kyoto a Farewell Glance**\n\nBack to Kyoto we now return\nLessons learned and bridges burn\nWith memories made a treasure trove\nOf sights and sounds to interweave.\nNijo Castle's grandeur we embrace\nA royal history time cannot erase.\nA final stroll a peaceful pace\nBefore departing from this place.\n\n**Day Seven: Departure a Fond Adieu**\n\nFarewell Japan a land so grand\nA journey cherished close at hand\nReturn to whence your journey led\nWith memories blooming in your head.\nMay fortune smile and joy abound\nIn all the places you have found.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.0026434261817485094}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.3232143828645349e-05}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -0.5096886157989502}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.009205871261656284}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.10256673395633698}, {"token": "▁Japan", "logprob": -0.9030031561851501}, {"token": "'", "logprob": -0.026592200621962547}, {"token": "s", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "▁fair", "logprob": -0.4669952690601349}, {"token": "▁shore", "logprob": -0.26230454444885254}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.05603298172354698}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.005860763601958752}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.02137913554906845}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.042191218584775925}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.23463484644889832}, {"token": "▁sight", "logprob": -0.5051407217979431}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.0005321278586052358}, {"token": "▁adore", "logprob": -0.1958020031452179}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.07772020250558853}, {"token": "Prepare", "logprob": -1.0272395610809326}, {"token": "▁thys", "logprob": -0.2250811606645584}, {"token": "elf", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.0016074366867542267}, {"token": "▁wonders", "logprob": -0.04156794771552086}, {"token": "▁untold", "logprob": -0.008476587943732738}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.0012902038870379329}, {"token": "A", "l